{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_title", "source_sha256": "b6b16d01d6741468fa334bf409438aa8aa70801f441e2a2ec405d88e352f6abf", "ja": "幼年期のみんなへ", "zh": "致童年时代的大家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "30fb6378aa62940c597ab3eb3e22590973eefa5cf8520c00f62a0cd57bc83e7d", "ja": "新しい仲間を迎え、装いも新たに、\nいっそうお友達を増やそうと宇宙を旅する\nミリオン星人たちの一幕です。", "zh": "迎来了新的同伴，换上了全新的装束，\n这是为了结交更多朋友而在宇宙中旅行的\n百万星人们的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1000_024ann", "source_sha256": "37cb73a826d88ffde99245c16ce30d24fcda336b64e71cbce685aa7f56e6e2e7", "ja": "これは、ひろいひろい宇宙の片隅のどこかで……\nあったかもしれないお話です☆", "zh": "这是在广阔无垠的宇宙某个角落……\n或许曾经发生过的故事☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "6ce8b74c159c02726f18de92f7098e0662a90b6f6e76c5d534519598af32663e", "ja": "や～。地球は、なまらいい星だったねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀～地球可真是个特别棒的星球呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1002_040tam", "source_sha256": "4da3146b6f773ce1d3ad0a9892309530399fc2b7dfb9aec9f10e2bf4d32dbd59", "ja": "たまきたち、いーっぱい『せんのー』して、\nいーっぱい『せーふく』しちゃったぞ！", "zh": "环她们，进行了好多好多次“洗脑”，还把它彻底“征服”了哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1003_022ser", "source_sha256": "522700605c0029478e62e860360b7b93d55e08e1d0e3930261226ab179dc09cf", "ja": "コブンちゃんも、\nご飯をいっぱい食べられてご機嫌です♪", "zh": "小弟也吃了好多东西，心情好极了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1004_kobun", "source_sha256": "6091933e438cb1e56cc04673779cb0b68581015041bef6f6748eafe7a5506bc7", "ja": "にゃー！", "zh": "喵～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1007_022ser", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "8fa2d8cebb176d0c8dfa65b215c1b193ece282fe648762fb43d6a0f47378ddf7", "ja": "せんのー！　せーふく！　せんせーしょん！", "zh": "洗脑！征服！大骚动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1009_024ann", "source_sha256": "74c4750c156f09b666c2fdb5d044916faedf19fa3c878e617d42d66354025760", "ja": "ビビッ！　『せんのー』は、一緒に歌ったり踊ったり\nすること！　『せーふく』は、お友達になることだよ☆", "zh": "哔哔！“一起唱跳”就是一起唱歌跳舞！“交朋友”就是成为朋友哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1010_022ser", "source_sha256": "fa97686d5866b77972baf64c469a5b40753968b3b47a14713a441b7b581678ec", "ja": "お友達、たくさん増えました♪　地球人のやよいさん、\n宇宙萩原組の雪歩さん、シマーバラ星人のエレナさん。", "zh": "朋友增加了好多呢♪来自地球的弥生、宇宙萩原组的雪步，还有岛原星人艾蕾娜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "4ed967d19bc2038b056fd5d6c172d82f23150cd127e5d1daf90f3540209a9c3f", "ja": "全部で52人の大所帯になったねぇ。\nせっかくだから、みんなの制服も新しくしたよぉ。", "zh": "总共有52人，已经变成一个大家庭了呢。难得有这个机会，我还把大家的制服也换新了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "adfba441218bd8afd923f86d5ecdaacca0e7f2f488964bd268c16fdf783c17cf", "ja": "ビビッとおそろいです！\n新人たちにも注目してね☆", "zh": "很有感觉的统一风格！\n也请关注新人们哦☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1013_030iku", "source_sha256": "dd9f3c9b5084eee0deed0742b825433ff88479040deef77db790c5342c1289b2", "ja": "こんにちは！\n新人の、中谷育です！　せんぱい、よろしくね！", "zh": "你好！\n我是新人中谷育！前辈，请多多指教！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1014_008tak", "source_sha256": "77eab026b7321a3fa6a63a0c9a23f35efba7c6a2c8913d862823e5b8179ff5c2", "ja": "新人の四条貴音です。宇宙には以前から興味が\nありました。ご指導をよろしくお願いいたします。", "zh": "我是新人四条贵音。我一直以来都对宇宙很感兴趣。还请您多多指导。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "b7fef210f7790287e609e9d0ba3022138bd818d4ab231b4218a81baecbde5a2d", "ja": "はや～。ふたりとも新人なのに、\nそうは思えないオーラだべさ……！", "zh": "好厉害～。明明两位都是新人，却有种完全不像新人的气场……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1016_040tam", "source_sha256": "8cc821ff13f66f03a977c024e4485fdc4e85e1da819b42bc1f51d5a452d695d1", "ja": "育、新しい制服、すっごく似合ってるぞ！\nかっこいい～♪", "zh": "育，你穿新制服特别合适！好帅～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1017_030iku", "source_sha256": "42bc3a473ca27ed2ec06008d5cc96eddcc98fa61dec74d77b91efc7185d2a043", "ja": "ほんと？　でも、子どもっぽくないかなぁ。", "zh": "真的吗？不过，会不会显得太孩子气了呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1018_008tak", "source_sha256": "8692321f18c6f60ad58e7f037dc2d548b7c7277c1cf6124bb11a537056beb2eb", "ja": "いいえ、すもっくはためらいなく活動するための、\n立派な仕事衣装。頼もしいですよ、育。", "zh": "不，罩衫可是让人能够毫不犹豫地开展活动的体面工作服。很可靠哦，育。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1019_022ser", "source_sha256": "a37fcc2e7b817f8eea20829c71bd2823f7e3b1051c07581deca1544067a0ce3e", "ja": "貴音さんも、とっても似合ってます。素敵です♪", "zh": "贵音小姐也非常合适。真漂亮♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "a1ab4416de92a878b2a42e2b5213cfcd8621f0bf8bed4bb324aa542e83fa745e", "ja": "仕事衣装……そっか、大人もスモックを着るんだ？\nじゃあわたしも、お姉さんの仲間入りだね！", "zh": "工作服……这样啊，原来大人也会穿罩衣？\n那我也算加入姐姐们的行列了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1021_030iku", "source_sha256": "55e9344f4251c6c668237e263bd684574f957b17fc8999e40e78819040acba8b", "ja": "それで、次はどこで『せんのー』するの？", "zh": "那么接下来要在哪里“洗手”呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1022_040tam", "source_sha256": "682fa511ae40e2fa90d1fd389dc7f192373c9467a7d5de7cb7034735650b8977", "ja": "たまき、もっといっぱい『せーふく』したい！", "zh": "环还想再多多“征服”一些！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1023_008tak", "source_sha256": "ea3647167161a7ef0e1802bbe4e1f5e7ec59dca201d8a7716dc762617689117d", "ja": "美しく明るく、幸せな星にたどり着きたいものです。\nたとえそれが、銀河の彼方であろうとも……。", "zh": "真希望能抵达那颗美丽、明亮而幸福的星星。即使它在银河的彼方……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1024_024ann", "source_sha256": "092fc6d46d08ad86de77c5a1f839d65f7a215f087e3db2e23b4d9d3a9aa16b49", "ja": "ビビッ！　意外とすぐ近くから\n明るくてフレッシュな電波をキャッチ！！", "zh": "哔哔！没想到竟然就在附近，捕捉到了明亮又新鲜的电波！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1025_022ser", "source_sha256": "ba2240d03d723d76c74644ea5ddf27e2b84a357f5d8edaee38b0220c6049cb07", "ja": "あれは！　銀河百科事典で見たことがあります。\n発見されたばかりの新惑星『アケオメ星』です！", "zh": "那是！我在银河百科全书上看到过。\n是刚被发现的新行星“新年星”！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1026_035hin", "source_sha256": "802b043d30f993d8fe97646d8d3e521fa352872385393030a99ea0343f8ce2f1", "ja": "お～、なんだか、おめでたい名前だねぇ。", "zh": "哦～，这个名字听起来还真喜庆呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "ee403e9dded6ede05d1fcb7c1e417d1bf8be3da64857dcb0828d9ec0fb7bc771", "ja": "どんな人たちが住んでるのかなぁ？\n友達になれるといいね！", "zh": "不知道那里住着什么样的人呢？\n要是能和他们成为朋友就好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1028_040tam", "source_sha256": "377e70a12a38550613544a034c015c8f8a62b758a477274df5bfabcc36b6d266", "ja": "くふふ、たまきたちの歌とダンスで、\nびっくりさせるぞ～！", "zh": "嘿嘿，要用环的歌声和舞蹈，把他们吓一跳～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_407_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_407_cc_01_1029_008tak", "source_sha256": "84317bcab1ef1d1e0ea211e2a2605c4682a1ebc66c11abc116e2a52c4c131923", "ja": "善は急げと申します。早速参りましょう。\n輝かしき、次なる舞台に向かって……いざ！", "zh": "常言道机不可失，事不宜迟。我们即刻出发吧。\n奔向那片闪耀的下一处舞台……出发！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
